nv set system hostname spine02
nv set interface lo ipv4 address 10.255.255.2

Configure MLAG on spine01
nv set interface peerlink bond member swp29-30
nv set mlag mac-address 44:38:39:00:00:0C ===> same MAC
nv set mlag backup 10.255.255.1 vrf mgmt
nv set mlag priotity 2000 ===> lower Priority
nv set mlag peer-ip linklocal
nv config apply

Preparing the bond interface
nv set interface bond1 bond member swp1
nv set bridge domain br_default vlan 1-3
nv set interface bond1 bridge domain br_default
nv config apply

Configure the MLAG ID
nv set interface bond1 bond mlag id 1
nv config apply